    "detailed_description": "<h1>Features in-game purchases</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/4af1bf2a93cb31bcc34b922177efa85b.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/ea0b227ce5dc4c43289b0ce8d82536c3.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div>A turn-based multiplayer strategy game inspired by Into The Breach. Take down your opponent\u2019s bases or characters to win. Strategize, position your squad, and battle both rivals and zombies. Customize your deck to boost your bases and characters. Pick 3 unique heroes, each with special abilities, and show off your strategic skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <i><strong>Synopsis</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tranquil village in the South Pole has been overrun by mysterious invaders. But where did they come from? A conspiracy surrounds an AI organization that recently expanded in Antarctica. Could they be behind this? Innocent villagers are transforming into zombies and attacking their fellow residents alongside the intruders. Defend your home and protect Antarctica!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer (PvP):</strong> You can be matched with random players of similar skill or invite a friend to join your lobby using a lobby code. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player VS AI:</strong> Compete against a powerful AI Bot that adjusts to your skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Custom match: </strong>Challenge your friends! They can join your lobby using a lobby code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f151ea522c12c10ad3b65af626c0a9a0.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing a PvPvE (Player vs Player vs Environment) battle. In this setup, both players (or a Player and AI Bot) confront each other as well as the challenging game <strong>Environment</strong>, symbolized by <strong>zombies</strong>. Zombies serve as a mutual adversary for both players, neutral and hostile to all parties involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/653be3c65c49854940d608407c8ea21a.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f8493c3059ec6f10924579f626b087ee.poster.avif?t=1752641181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f8493c3059ec6f10924579f626b087ee.webm?t=1752641181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Create two unique decks of characters and ability cards before your game. The deck collects information about your win rate with a particular character and card setup. Evaluate your decks and opt for the most potent one. Experiment with different card and character combinations to craft the optimal strategy. Be mindful of your deck selection as it decides the outcome of your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/2806307e05ae658d5ad9a4050a835c22.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Relics to enhance your character\u2019s abilities during a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/383f968457dde3ff0a3c9f8c6ce37e91.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/8097a25ce96b41fd7ec6e0a99adf2889.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/ea0b227ce5dc4c43289b0ce8d82536c3.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div>A turn-based multiplayer strategy game inspired by Into The Breach. Take down your opponent\u2019s bases or characters to win. Strategize, position your squad, and battle both rivals and zombies. Customize your deck to boost your bases and characters. Pick 3 unique heroes, each with special abilities, and show off your strategic skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <i><strong>Synopsis</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tranquil village in the South Pole has been overrun by mysterious invaders. But where did they come from? A conspiracy surrounds an AI organization that recently expanded in Antarctica. Could they be behind this? Innocent villagers are transforming into zombies and attacking their fellow residents alongside the intruders. Defend your home and protect Antarctica!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer (PvP):</strong> You can be matched with random players of similar skill or invite a friend to join your lobby using a lobby code. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player VS AI:</strong> Compete against a powerful AI Bot that adjusts to your skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Custom match: </strong>Challenge your friends! They can join your lobby using a lobby code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f151ea522c12c10ad3b65af626c0a9a0.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing a PvPvE (Player vs Player vs Environment) battle. In this setup, both players (or a Player and AI Bot) confront each other as well as the challenging game <strong>Environment</strong>, symbolized by <strong>zombies</strong>. Zombies serve as a mutual adversary for both players, neutral and hostile to all parties involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/653be3c65c49854940d608407c8ea21a.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f8493c3059ec6f10924579f626b087ee.poster.avif?t=1752641181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/f8493c3059ec6f10924579f626b087ee.webm?t=1752641181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Create two unique decks of characters and ability cards before your game. The deck collects information about your win rate with a particular character and card setup. Evaluate your decks and opt for the most potent one. Experiment with different card and character combinations to craft the optimal strategy. Be mindful of your deck selection as it decides the outcome of your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/2806307e05ae658d5ad9a4050a835c22.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Relics to enhance your character\u2019s abilities during a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/383f968457dde3ff0a3c9f8c6ce37e91.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184470/extras/8097a25ce96b41fd7ec6e0a99adf2889.avif?t=1752641181\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer turn-based strategy game inspired by Into The Breach, set on a 9x9 board, where you control characters and protect bases. Create a unique deck of ability cards and characters. Eliminate the opponent while fending off a zombie horde. Become a savior of The South Pole!",
